{"id":"n15018-1-10","stage":2,"title":"뒷모습 · 背影","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15018-1-10-1","ko":"야, 앞에 가는 여자 뒷모습이 정말 예쁘다.","zh":"喂，前面走的那位女生的背影真的好漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"야：喂","readings":[{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58149","senseId":"2","lemma":"야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"가는","meaning":"走","explanation":"가다：走；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"13","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"여자","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"뒷모습이","meaning":"背影","explanation":"뒷모습：背影；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뒷모습","audio":"/audio/168ad64602c97d73c70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15018","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒷모습이","audio":"/audio/589ec0d221076cced0bc.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘다.","meaning":"漂亮、好看（外貌）","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮、好看（外貌）；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08945f015d460ad9","term":"야","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/08945f015d460ad9b44c.mp3","entryId":"58149","definition":"大人叫孩子时，或者年龄相等的人之间招呼时用的词语。","pronunciation":["야ː"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"走","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"通过某种途径移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"168ad64602c97d73","term":"뒷모습","zh":"背影","audio":"/audio/168ad64602c97d73c70a.mp3","entryId":"15018","definition":"从背后看的样子。","pronunciation":["뒨ː모습"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮、好看（外貌）","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"漂亮、好看（外貌）","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d1f294bc29814456acc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15018-1-10-2","ko":"그러게. 앞모습도 아름다울 것 같아.","zh":"是啊，我觉得她的正面应该也很漂亮吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게.","meaning":"那是，可不是","explanation":"그러게：那是，可不是","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36268","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"앞모습도","meaning":"正面长相，外貌","explanation":"앞모습：正面长相，外貌；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"앞모습","audio":"/audio/902473d11196509701cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90966","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞모습도","audio":"/audio/79196c947da56041cadd.mp3"}},{"text":"아름다울","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름다울","audio":"/audio/5a5a487d84ce1cf3d2dc.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"某种情况（-ㄹ 것 같다：推测）","explanation":"아름다울 것 같다：推测正面也很漂亮。这里推测尚未看到的长相，不一定指未来才发生的变化。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"那是，可不是","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36268","definition":"用于向对方强调自己以前说过的话是正确的。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"902473d111965097","term":"앞모습","zh":"正面长相，外貌","audio":"/audio/902473d11196509701cb.mp3","entryId":"90966","definition":"从前面看到的样子。","pronunciation":["암모습"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"某种情况（-ㄹ 것 같다：推测）","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"某种情况（-ㄹ 것 같다：推测）","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e8ef59cf67acb7a66e6c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.457,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15018","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.2837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，我觉得她的正面应该也很漂亮吧。","我们爷爷今年九十五岁了。","喂，前面走的那位女生的背影真的好漂亮啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是啊，我觉得她的正面应该也很漂亮吧。","喂，前面走的那位女生的背影真的好漂亮啊。","我们爷爷今年九十五岁了。"],"answer":0}]}
